WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:50.550
The Fearsome
<i>American Power</i> !

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:58.430
Wow, this is <i>yummy</i>!

00:01:58.430 --> 00:01:59.890
This is pretty good, isn't it?

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:04.890
Here the menu is built around each athlete's training and preferences.

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:06.890
I see.

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:12.860
Gramps only ever cooks fish.
As a grade school boy, I'd like to eat more me—

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:17.030
I see you don't understand my cooking made with love.

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:19.920
That's not it, but I'm in the middle of growing up!

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.910
But fish is an excellent source of nutrition.

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:24.280
Did you hear that, Takao?

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:26.520
I get it, I get it!

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:30.350
When you're done eating,
you should head back to the hotel.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:34.800
We're pretty far away from the town. If you don't hurry up, it's going to get late.

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:38.290
Because I lost against Emily, Mama is...

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.550
Max, Stadium out.

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:51.920
The winner is Emily.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.520
Director Judy.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:57.570
I leave the rest to you, Jeff.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:58.850
Yes, Ma'am.

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:00.400
See you, Max.

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:01.840
Emily, let's go.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:02.760
Yes.

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:06.080
Mama...

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.910
I'm full, I'm full.

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:16.710
Takao, you like everything you eat.
What a jolly fellow you are.

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:19.780
Since we get the chance to eat, isn't it better that way?

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:21.640
You're right about that!

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:24.090
Max, you don't look so good.

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:27.560
I put on an embarrassing show right in front of Mama...

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:28.790
Don't sweat it!

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:33.330
If we win the American tournament, I'm sure your Mom will change her mind about you.

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:35.880
Will she?

00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:41.860
The battles earlier, they didn't look like easy wins to me.

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:44.860
Kai is right. We mustn't let our guards down.

00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:48.290
Max lost to Emily, a first string player. This is a fact.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:52.390
But that's because he was taken aback!

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:54.880
She used that weird-looking Shooter and all.

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:59.130
Do you also use that kind of excuse in battle?!

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:04.600
Professor-kun and Kai-kun are right.

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:08.130
Overestimating yourself will cause you to act carelessly.

00:04:08.130 --> 00:04:12.330
You must be focused and ready to give your all at any time.

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:14.640
At the same time, no point in feeling down.

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:19.170
Takao is right in saying that it's nothing to worry about.

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:22.120
It's not like you can't get back from that defeat, right?

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:25.260
Use your defeat to make you stronger.

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:27.190
Yes, Sir!

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:30.110
Geezers always know the right words to say!

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:31.800
Who's the geezer?!

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:35.290
That's no way to refer to our senior citizens, Takao.

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:39.860
I'm still young! Look at these elegant moves!

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:54.160
Say, why don't we explore this place? I'm sure there are a lot of facilities they haven't shown us.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:59.820
Indeed, I think the places they have shown us were level one, two at best.

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:01.820
What's this 'level one' stuff?

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:04.590
It means they're not that important.

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:07.490
But is it alright for us to look around?

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:10.340
What will be, will be.
What do you say, Professor?

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:14.780
I can't say no to my curiosity. I'm going with you.

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:16.710
Same with me. What about you, Max?

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.710
Of course! I'm going too!

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:21.960
Alright then, it's decided!
Let's go! Are you coming with, Kai?

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:24.730
I'm staying here.

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:27.800
I knew you would say that. We'll be back soon!

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:46.740
We were able to sneak in
this easily... It's not even fun.

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:55.330
Thanks to you acting as a cushion, I'm safe.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:57.280
You're heavy...

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:20.280
There's nobody around.

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:21.460
This is perfect.

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:25.360
That's a level 3 room. The facilities from here onward house important research.

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:37.000
<i>A training room?</i>

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:42.990
Wow! It's so big, and look at all these machines... It's completely different from the places they showed us.

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:47.410
Of course it is. They couldn't show us all the aces they're hiding up their sleeves.

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:52.820
Wow, this is amazing! The training machines alone are worth billions of yen!

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:53.960
<i>Wow!</i>

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:58.200
There's even a computer for virtual image training.

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:02.580
The PPB's funds and technology are incredible!

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:06.700
What the heck..?!

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:09.700
A fridge... is not what that thing is, right?

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.080
It's a super computer.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:16.450
Still, look at how many there are. Just how much data are they analyzing here?

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:19.030
I've never seen computers like these!

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:22.320
Looks like it's doing some <i>battle simulations</i>.

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:24.390
Professor!

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:29.200
I want it! At least one of them!

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:33.390
Label four, huh.

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:35.430
I's 'level'.

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.240
Whoa!

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:47.040
What the?!

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.580
This is amazing.

00:07:48.580 --> 00:07:51.210
Just how big is this laboratory?

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:57.410
Not only does this laboratory excel in scientific research, you can even play any kind of sport here!

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:00.060
Mama, what are you doing here..?

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:06.870
Still, the places we've been this morning were full of people, but everywhere since level three has been deserted.

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:11.470
Maybe the levels from three up are reserved to the first string members.

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:14.800
The PPB is really amazing.

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:18.560
This place looks like it's hiding some top secret stuff.

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.530
Granpa-san!

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:40.400
With all these facilities... I'm sure they have some information about the Sacred Beasts here.

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:48.000
What secrets could be hiding beyond this point?

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.530
After what we've seen, I can't even guess.

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:53.250
Be careful, they have set up a security system.

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:55.970
This must mean some big secrets lie ahead.

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:58.830
You can tell us to 'be careful' all you want, but...

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:01.490
Can't you do something about this sensor?!

00:09:01.490 --> 00:09:03.360
Takao, stay still!

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:09.350
Retina scan confirmed. You can proceed.

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:25.670
Mama!

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.380
Max?

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:29.880
Mama!

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:31.160
Max!

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:31.880
Takao!

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:46.220
Max!

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:47.660
Mama!

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:49.370
Kai!

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:49.900
Max!

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:53.400
Mama! Mama!

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:58.270
I think he's calling you. Is this okay, Director?

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:10.840
Mama! Mama! There's so much
I want to talk to you about!

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:14.120
About your pendant, about Daddy...

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:20.560
It's because I lost to that girl... Is that why you're being so cold with me?

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:22.790
Mama!

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:23.640
Max...

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:27.400
Move, Max.

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:28.400
Takao!

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:33.160
I'll break any wall that separates you from your Mom!

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:45.890
Dragoon's frontal attack didn't even scratch it. Just how robust is that door?!

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:51.090
Who cares about that! We have to run! What we've done goes against the tournament rules!

00:10:51.090 --> 00:10:52.770
But what about Max's Mom?!

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:55.130
Takao, thank you.

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:57.290
But we should get away from here.

00:10:58.650 --> 00:11:00.270
Alright, let's bail.

00:11:00.270 --> 00:11:01.510
It's too late.

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:26.010
We're trapped.

00:11:26.010 --> 00:11:30.310
Oh boy. They told us some intruders broke in, so we thought it was a spy or something...

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:32.620
If it isn't the guys from the BBA team.

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:36.010
The alarm stopped!

00:11:36.010 --> 00:11:37.300
Who the heck are you guys?!

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:40.510
Isn't that what <i>we</i> should be saying?

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:46.270
Oh, yeah, you're right. Who the heck do you think we are?!

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:49.230
I already said, you're the BBA team.

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:52.690
Ding ding ding! Correct! How did you guess that?

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:58.390
So the BBA team is sneaking inside the American team's laboratory to spy on us?

00:11:58.390 --> 00:12:02.740
Then again, even if you spy on us, you have no chance of beating us.

00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:05.810
You still haven't told us your names, you know.

00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:10.400
Us? We don't usually tell our names to spies, but...

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:14.280
Since we're gentlemen, we'll make an exception.

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:16.260
We're not anything special really.

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:20.200
We're just fist string members of the American team.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:21.710
First string?!

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:28.340
<i>My name is Steve.</i>

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:38.970
I'm Eddie. I see you won against the second string players, but you won't be able to win against us.

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:41.630
You're first string members of the American team?

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:45.750
Considering your second string, you can't be muc better...

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:49.160
You sure talk big, but didn't you struggle against them?

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.730
And you were utterly defeated by Emily.

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:52.640
What was that?!

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:53.750
Takao, calm down!

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:56.120
Still, you were spying on us...

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:57.960
How underhanded.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:02.000
Who's the one who lost to Emily?

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:05.000
Max was just caught off guard!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:08.250
Max... I know that name.

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:11.980
Oh, right. You're Director Judy's son.

00:13:12.490 --> 00:13:15.440
To think you ended up in the BBA team.

00:13:16.140 --> 00:13:19.070
I guess you didn't meet the Director's expectations.

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:20.240
What do you mean?

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:24.490
As proof of that, the Director didn't choose you to be part of the American team.

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:27.850
Max's Mom was the one who chose you?

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:30.460
Yep, she scouted us herself.

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:32.200
No way..!

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:37.290
Your Mama picked me, Eddie and Emily.

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:38.760
Emily...

00:13:38.760 --> 00:13:41.970
The girl who defeated me before Mama's eyes...

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:44.040
And our leader, Micheal.

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:49.290
Together, we are the four fist string members.

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:54.110
Too bad your Mama didn't choose you, huh, Max-kun.

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:59.080
That just means you weren't good enough.

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:01.640
Cut the crap, will you?!

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:02.320
Rei.

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:03.820
Oh, so scary.

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:07.070
We're just telling it like it is

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:12.890
How about we give you a taste of the BBA team's power? Wanna try?

00:14:12.890 --> 00:14:15.710
That won't do! We can't fight before the tournament!

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:17.500
You came to visit the PPB.

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:20.760
And you did a bit of training.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:23.040
This shouldn't be a problem to anyone.

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:24.540
Enough talking!

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:26.750
Very well. I'll take you on.

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:37.500
That's... a football-shaped Shooter?!

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:40.400
Rei..!

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:45.220
Let's go.

00:14:45.220 --> 00:14:46.110
Okay.

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:49.730
Three, Two, One!

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:52.830
Go... Shoot!

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:14.860
I don't care if you're first string or whatever, you're not going to beat Rei!

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:21.680
Nice moves.

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:23.200
Yeah, he's good.

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:24.700
You're going to regret this.

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:26.870
Hey, don't get me wrong now.

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:28.200
What..?

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:30.950
Steve said that he's better then we thought, that's it.

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:32.700
W-What did you say?!

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:34.880
You'll be sorry if you if you underestimate me.

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:37.780
Rei! Show him your power!

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:38.660
Right on.

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:41.450
Let's go! Tiger Claw!

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:54.400
Looking good, Rei!

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:55.390
Go, go!

00:15:56.180 --> 00:16:02.890
This is weird... Is <i>this</i> the result of Mama's research?

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:04.660
Time's up.

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:05.980
What?!

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:11.110
Being the gentleman I am, I gave you a chance to defeat my Tryhorn.

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:13.970
This is it. Go, Tryhorn!

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:20.160
C-Could it be..?!

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:28.680
A Sacred Beast?!

00:16:28.680 --> 00:16:30.960
The American team had a Sacred Beast too?!

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:34.470
You're not the only one who can control the Sacred Beasts.

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:39.550
I knew it. There are Sacred Beast
users in the American team.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.150
Go, Byakko!

00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:46.650
Go!

00:16:55.960 --> 00:17:01.070
Tryhorn? Doesn't look very strong. Is this the true power of America's first string?

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:05.340
How naive. Tryhorn's Death Rush is just about to begin!

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:11.000
What..?!

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:12.170
What is this?!

00:17:12.520 --> 00:17:20.440
American football is all about power and speed, just like a buffalo herd!

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:23.240
Driger, unleash your Tiger Claw!

00:17:35.440 --> 00:17:36.310
What?!

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:37.690
Driger...

00:17:37.690 --> 00:17:42.120
Did you see that? This is our difference in power.

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:44.120
America's power!

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:57.420
The glass..! The same bullet-proof  glass Dragoon couldn't even scratch...

00:17:57.420 --> 00:17:58.930
What amazing power...

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:03.240
The power of your Beyblade can't even dream of competing with my Tryhorn.

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:11.450
The Beyblades developed by Director Judy,  and the training based on scientific theory we went through makes us invincible.

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:12.990
Mama developed those...

00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:14.440
Rei...

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:20.120
We'll keep this spying matter
a secret from the committee.

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:24.560
Even if we fight against you at the tournament, you're not a threat to us.

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:27.160
Now that you know just how weak you are, scram!

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:28.390
What did you say?!

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:30.080
Takao, let's go back.

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:31.360
But, Max..!

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:34.000
We are in the wrong, since we snuck in here.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:40.800
They said they will keep silent about this whole matter, so I think we should follow their advice and leave.

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:44.190
I guess you're right. We're sorry.

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:45.510
That's good to hear.

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:47.600
But let me tell you one thing.

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:48.680
Takao?

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:54.440
If we meet again at the American tournament, you're going to regret this!

00:18:57.770 --> 00:18:58.940
Let's go.

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:05.940
That must be the highest level of secret facility.

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:09.080
Well, It'll just leave something to look forward to.

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:18.800
That Rei kid, he has skills, but he's no threat to us.

00:19:19.780 --> 00:19:24.050
This is not the extent of America's scientific research.

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:28.840
This is only the beginning. Once my research is complete, you'll see...

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:32.140
The era of relying on insinct and feel is over.

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:34.710
This is the era of science and calculation.

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:40.730
By the way, was it you who lowered the security level to let the BBA team sneak in,  Secretary Douglas?

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:45.220
Well, there's no such thing as 'too much data' about our opponents.

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:50.190
And even if the data from this facility were to leak, it's not a big deal.

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:55.300
Of course, we couldn't allow them to get into level five.

00:19:55.300 --> 00:19:56.880
It was good training, was it not?

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:58.740
I guess so, Secretary.

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:01.660
Our leader Micheal will come back soon.

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:04.800
And in any case, we won't lose to them anyway.

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:08.140
I know I can trust your words.

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:12.660
By the way, Director Judy, what about your son in the BBA team?

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:18.200
Yes, he is my dear son. But that has nothing to do with Beyblade.

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:21.960
If he faces off against the American team, we <i>will</i> take him down.

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:24.600
That's Director Judy for you.

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:25.320
Yes.

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:33.300
Grandpa-san! Let us meet again!

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:39.720
I'm pooped. I got carried away and went overboard.

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:43.550
The American team's first string...

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:47.120
Takao, you said they'd regret this...
Do you have a plan of some kind?

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:50.480
Of course I don't! I'm going to think one up now!

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:52.840
That's what I thought.

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:55.070
Still, that power...

00:20:55.070 --> 00:20:58.190
Yeah... They <i>are strong.</i>

00:20:58.190 --> 00:21:01.180
ì If you have time to brood, think of why we lost!

00:21:01.180 --> 00:21:02.840
And look for a breakthrough!

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:04.560
I know, I know!

00:21:05.230 --> 00:21:07.180
PPB team...

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:11.530
Breakthough... That's easy to say, but...

00:21:12.210 --> 00:21:13.960
Sacred Beasts...

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:16.760
and power...

00:21:20.270 --> 00:21:22.410
Mama and the American team...

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:25.000
are our enemy...

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.190 --> 00:23:01.290
According to my analysis, this is bad! Seriously bad!

00:23:01.290 --> 00:23:03.860
We can't win against the PPB team like this!

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.660
That's why, thanks to President Daitenji, we're going for special training at a secret base.

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:13.450
Training machines and Beyblade development equipment!

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:16.970
...Is what I was expecting, but what we found instead was...

00:23:16.970 --> 00:23:20.480
Next time: Special Training! In Search for New Power!

00:23:20.480 --> 00:23:24.560
Antonio? <i>Who are you?</i>
